<title>USA: PG&amp;E says Diablo Canyon 2 nuke at 90 pct, rising.</title>
<headline>PG&amp;E says Diablo Canyon 2 nuke at 90 pct, rising.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Gas &amp; Electric Co's 1,073 megawatt (MW) Diablo Canyon 2 nuclear unit was at 90 percent power as of early Monday after ramping down over the weekend for repairs, the company said.</p>
<p>PG&amp;E said the unit was expected to reach 100 percent capacity later on Monday.</p>
<p>((--Los Angeles bureau + 1 213 955 6761))</p>
</text>
